{
    "title": "MoonPay: Buy Bitcoin, Solana",
    "description": "Streamline your web3 experience with the MoonPay app and join millions of people who purchase crypto with MoonPay.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n\r\nUNIFIED WALLET MANAGEMENT\r\n- Manage all your cryptocurrency wallets in one place \r\n- Connect with multiple crypto wallet integration\r\n- View detailed purchase history\r\n\r\n\r\nBUY CRYPTO WITH A VARIETY OF PAYMENT METHODS\r\nMoonPay allows you to buy cryptocurrency like Bitcoin (BTC) in just a few clicks using your preferred payment methods like:\r\n- Debit cards\r\n- Credit cards (Visa, MasterCard)\r\n- Mobile payment options (Apple Pay, Google Pay, \r\n- Bank transfer\r\n- Local payment methods\r\nand more!\r\n\r\n\r\nSWAP CRYPTO WITH NO PROCESSING FEES\r\n- Exchange cryptocurrency cross-chain between multiple wallets\r\n- Swap crypto cross-chain with zero processing fees\r\n- Connect your crypto wallet app using WalletConnect\r\n- Access a vast selection of crypto trading pairs for seamless exchanges\r\n\r\n\r\nMANY SUPPORTED CRYPTOCURRENCIES AND COUNTRIES\r\nWith MoonPay, you can buy Bitcoin, Bitcoin Cash, Ethereum, Dogecoin, Chainlink, Litecoin, Solana, Polkadot, XRP and dozens more cryptocurrency tokens.\r\nSend your purchased tokens to your preferred non-custodial wallet.\r\nAvailable in more than 130 countries, MoonPay is trusted by leading wallets, websites, and applications.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSECURE PLATFORM\r\nAll MoonPay products are built with security and privacy in mind. So whether you use MoonPay to buy, sell, or swap crypto, your information is encrypted and data safe.\r\n\r\n\r\nHOW DO I BUY CRYPTOCURRENCY?\r\nSimply download the MoonPay app, select a cryptocurrency from the drop-down menu of dozens of coins and enter how much you\u2019d like to purchase in your preferred currency. \r\nJust enter your wallet address and ensure that it's compatible with the cryptocurrency you\u2019re purchasing. For example, if you want to buy Bitcoin (BTC) then you\u2019ll need to enter a valid Bitcoin wallet address.\r\n\r\nU.S. RESIDENTS CAN BUY CRYPTO ASSETS INCLUDING:\r\n- Bitcoin (BTC)\r\n- Ethereum (ETH)\r\n- Algorand (ALGO)\r\n- Avalanche (AVAX)\r\n- Bitcoin Cash (BCH)\r\n- Cardano (ADA)\r\n- Chainlink (LINK)\r\n- Dai (DAI)\r\n- Dogecoin (DOGE)\r\n- Eos (EOS)\r\n- Flow (FLOW)\r\n- Hedera (HBAR)\r\n- Immutable (IMX)\r\n- Litecoin (LTC)\r\n- Near Protocol (NEAR)\r\n- Polkadot (DOT)\r\n- Polygon (MATIC)\r\n- Shiba Inu (SHIB)\r\n- Solana (SOL)\r\n- Stellar Lumens (XLM)\r\n- Tether (USDT)\r\n- TrueUSD (TUSD)\r\n- Tezos (XTZ)\r\n- USDC (USDC)\r\nAnd many more!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNON U.S. RESIDENTS CAN BUY CRYPTO ASSETS INCLUDING:\r\n- Bitcoin (BTC)\r\n- Ethereum (ETH)\r\n- Aave (AAVE)\r\n- Algorand (ALGO)\r\n- Avalanche (AVAX)\r\n- Axie Infinity Shards (AXS)\r\n- Binance Coin (BNB)\r\n- Bitcoin Cash (BCH)\r\n- Cardano (ADA)\r\n- Chainlink (LINK)\r\n- Dai (DAI)\r\n- Decentraland (MANA)\r\n- Dogecoin (DOGE)\r\n- Eos (EOS)\r\n- Ethereum Classic (ETC)\r\n- Hedera (HBAR)\r\n- Immutable (IMX)\r\n- Litecoin (LTC)\r\n- Maker (MKR)\r\n- Near Protocol (NEAR)\r\n- Polkadot (DOT)\r\n- Polygon (MATIC)\r\n- Shiba Inu (SHIB)\r\n- Solana (SOL)\r\n- Stellar (XLM)\r\n- Tether (USDT)\r\n- Tezos (XTZ)\r\n- The Sandbox (SAND)\r\n- Tron (TRX)\r\n- TrueUSD (TUSD)\r\n- Uniswap (UNI)\r\n- USDC (USDC)\r\n- VeChain (VET)\r\n- Wrapped Bitcoin (WBTC)\r\n- Wrapped Ethereum (WETH)\r\n- XRP (XRP)\r\nAnd much more!\r\n\r\n\r\nFollow MoonPay on social media:\r\nTwitter: @moonpay\r\nFacebook: @officialmoonpay\r\nInstagram: @moonpay\r\n\r\nHelp & Support:\r\nhttps://support.moonpay.com/\r\n\r\nMoonPay USA LLC & Hypermint USA LLC \r\n8 The Green, Suite B Dover, DE 19901",
    "descriptionHTML": "Streamline your web3 experience with the MoonPay app and join millions of people who purchase crypto with MoonPay.<br><br>Key features include:<br><br>UNIFIED WALLET MANAGEMENT<br>- Manage all your cryptocurrency wallets in one place <br>- Connect with multiple crypto wallet integration<br>- View detailed purchase history<br><br><br>BUY CRYPTO WITH A VARIETY OF PAYMENT METHODS<br>MoonPay allows you to buy cryptocurrency like Bitcoin (BTC) in just a few clicks using your preferred payment methods like:<br>- Debit cards<br>- Credit cards (Visa, MasterCard)<br>- Mobile payment options (Apple Pay, Google Pay, <br>- Bank transfer<br>- Local payment methods<br>and more!<br><br><br>SWAP CRYPTO WITH NO PROCESSING FEES<br>- Exchange cryptocurrency cross-chain between multiple wallets<br>- Swap crypto cross-chain with zero processing fees<br>- Connect your crypto wallet app using WalletConnect<br>- Access a vast selection of crypto trading pairs for seamless exchanges<br><br><br>MANY SUPPORTED CRYPTOCURRENCIES AND COUNTRIES<br>With MoonPay, you can buy Bitcoin, Bitcoin Cash, Ethereum, Dogecoin, Chainlink, Litecoin, Solana, Polkadot, XRP and dozens more cryptocurrency tokens.<br>Send your purchased tokens to your preferred non-custodial wallet.<br>Available in more than 130 countries, MoonPay is trusted by leading wallets, websites, and applications.<br><br><br><br>SECURE PLATFORM<br>All MoonPay products are built with security and privacy in mind. So whether you use MoonPay to buy, sell, or swap crypto, your information is encrypted and data safe.<br><br><br>HOW DO I BUY CRYPTOCURRENCY?<br>Simply download the MoonPay app, select a cryptocurrency from the drop-down menu of dozens of coins and enter how much you\u2019d like to purchase in your preferred currency. <br>Just enter your wallet address and ensure that it&#39;s compatible with the cryptocurrency you\u2019re purchasing. For example, if you want to buy Bitcoin (BTC) then you\u2019ll need to ente